  "_about": "Where each product keeps Hawkes Gen's JS SDK. Products keep copies (their own CI and site builds can't read this private repo), and `node bin/hawkesgen-sdk.mjs sync` writes the current files into every one; `status` lists the ones behind. Paths are folders in each repo (next to C:\\Projects\\hawkesgen, /srv/hawkes on the server). Add a product here when it starts using the SDK.",
